Item #:  SCP-5232

Object Class:  Keter-Pending Keter(See Experiment transcript 3 for more details.) 

Special Containment Procedures:  SCP-5232 is to be contained inside a 3m2 containment chamber, inside of a case comprised mainly of Glass, Pyrex, and [DATA EXPUNGED]. An exclusion zone of 3m2 is to be maintained at all times, outside of testing. The only personnel allowed inside the exclusion zone are Class-D personnel. Any other personnel to be placed inside are to be first cleared by 2 Overseer-Class Personnel. All testing is to be overseen by One (1) Level-3 Personnel or higher. Any Level-1 and -2 Personnel who access information divulging the existence of SCP-5232 are to be administered Class-B amnestics by using a textual Infohazard.

Protocol 202-5232-A forbids any foundation personnel to enter the cell other then Class-D personnel, and even then inside the perimeters of testing.

It has also been concluded that SCP-5232 is indestructible, and shall be treated accordingly.(See addendum SCP-5232-1 for more details.) 

Description:  SCP-5232 is a six-sided silver dice of unknown origin (See addendum SCP-5232-1 for more details) .SCP-5232 does not manifest any anomalous properties until an entity (humans, animals,or plants) comes within 3m2 of SCP-5232. If an entity comes within the aforementioned area, the dice will proceed to roll itself through unknown means, which tests have shown is completely randomized. (See SCP-5232 testing log for more details.) 

Once this has happened, an event (known as SCP-5232-1 through -6) will manifest (see SCP-5232 testing logs for more details.) . it is unknown how the dice achieves these events.


